{"questionId":"u03-s006-v001","unitId":"u03","numericUnitId":3,"topicId":"u03-linear-equation-solving","skillId":"linear-equation-fractions","difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"解 x/3＝7。","choices":["21","7/3","10","4"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"兩邊同乘3；x=7×3=21。所以答案是「21」。","steps":["將等式兩邊同乘 3。","得到 x＝7×3。","計算得 x＝21，代回 21÷3＝7。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"21","truth":true,"reason":"x/3=7 的兩邊同乘 3，得到 x=21。"},{"choice":"7/3","truth":false,"reason":"把 x/3=7 的右邊又除以 3，會得到 7/3。"},{"choice":"10","truth":false,"reason":"把 x/3 錯看成 x−3，解 x−3=7 得 10。"},{"choice":"4","truth":false,"reason":"把 x/3 錯看成 x+3，解 x+3=7 得 4。"}],"commonMistake":"看到分母就再除一次。","concept":"乘分母可消去除法。","tags":["代數","含分母的一元一次方程式","basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":"75","prerequisiteSkillIds":["linear-equation-parentheses"],"authoringIntent":"解最基本分母型方程式。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"2976accfa3f69f1fda4e42cb8458528cb589e74ead6032be7e5bcaac48af5a1b","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","legacyContentDisposition":"replace-old-record-at-final-integration"}
